{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini Games That Won\u2019t Let You Idle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hang out with a goofy, lovable sheepdog in this bite-sized desktop mini game collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for those little breaks\u2014between tasks, while waiting for a game to download, or just when your brain needs a breather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 10 mini games right from your desktop\u2014just click and go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it\u2019s time to get back to work, just click on another window and the game auto-pauses for you. Smooth, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Always Ready on Your Desktop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiding at the edge of your screen, just hover your mouse and it pops up\u2014ready to play anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/064c63ddb7655c684c08f9036016b3f6.poster.avif?t=1774338329\" width=1170 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/064c63ddb7655c684c08f9036016b3f6.webm?t=1774338329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/064c63ddb7655c684c08f9036016b3f6.mp4?t=1774338329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a1 Perfect for Micro-Breaks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can\u2019t sit still? These quick games are made for you. Instant fun, no commitment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/d2d4ab991e9329fd73368b57f14d805f.poster.avif?t=1774338329\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/d2d4ab991e9329fd73368b57f14d805f.webm?t=1774338329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/d2d4ab991e9329fd73368b57f14d805f.mp4?t=1774338329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc15 Your Sidekick Is a Silly Sheepdog</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s a bit clumsy, but totally adorable. Join him and his barnyard buddies for some chaotic, heartwarming fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/bdeb9cd10de0354ffcde7bf271c70790.poster.avif?t=1774338329\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/bdeb9cd10de0354ffcde7bf271c70790.webm?t=1774338329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/bdeb9cd10de0354ffcde7bf271c70790.mp4?t=1774338329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Global Leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players around the world and feel that cozy mix of casual rivalry and connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/ea7d1825a1a7fe13d8b041e466809eb7.poster.avif?t=1774338329\" width=300 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965600/extras/ea7d1825a1a7fe13d8b041e466809eb7.webm?t=1774338329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i